      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under dry nitrogen using Schlenk/cannula or glovebox techniques, a THF solution (10 mL) of [Me2Si(C5Me4)(C2B10H11)]Li(OEt2)0.5 (1; 0.183 g, 0.50 mmol) was slowly added to a suspension of NdCl3 (0.125 g, 0.50 mmol) in 15 mL of THF and the mixture was stirred overnight at room temperature. THF was removed, the blue residue was extracted with diethyl ether (3 × 10 mL), and the combined extracts were concentrated. Recrystallization from THF/Et2O gave 3 as blue microcrystals (0.318 g, 80%).",
