        "procedure": "To a suspension of NaNH2 (0.160 g, 4.0 mmol) in THF (20 mL) was added a THF solution (10 mL) of [Me2Si(C5Me4)(C2B10H11)]Li(OEt2)0.5 (1; 0.366 g, 1.0 mmol), and the mixture was stirred at room temperature for 24 h. The colorless solution was filtered into a stirred suspension of YbCl3 (0.280 g, 1.0 mmol) in THF (10 mL) at room temperature and stirred overnight. After removal of solvent, the residue was extracted with n-hexane (3 × 10 mL). Combined hexane extracts were concentrated to about 10 mL and cooled to −20 °C, affording 7 as red crystals (0.080 g, 25%).",
